{"title": "Durable", "pageid": 8370, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Durable", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Durable.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Durable.webp/300px-Durable.webp, /w/images/2/2e/Durable.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Durable.webp/300px-Durable.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Durable.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Durable</b> is a Passive Feature obtainable by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. You regain full HP every time you take a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Regain full <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> every time you take a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short Rest</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Durable_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Durable (Feat)\">Durable (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203102\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.023 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 455/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1438/4194304 b